  "«Aunque» introduce concesión; la relativa sin comas restringe a «los técnicos» y es especificativa; el sujeto de «reanudaron» es «los técnicos que llegaron temprano», cuyo núcleo es «técnicos».": "\"Although\" introduces concession; The relative without commas restricts to \"the technicians\" and is specific; The subject of “they resumed” is “the technicians who arrived early,” the core of which is “technicians.”",
