  "Para P(x)=∏(x−r), se cumple P′(t)/P(t)=Σ1/(t−r). Con t=−2, la suma pedida es −P′(−2)/P(−2). Como P′(−2)=47 y P(−2)=−60, resulta 47/60.": "For P(x)=∏(x−r), P′(t)/P(t)=Σ1/(t−r) holds. With t=−2, the requested sum is −P′(−2)/P(−2). Since P′(−2)=47 and P(−2)=−60, it is 47/60.",
